        "product_summary": "Synthetic leather upper: A pebbled surface, plain side panels and a curved stitched forefoot seam create a clean casual silhouette.\nCord lacing: Looped cords cross the tongue, with a metal upper eyelet and visible stitched lace-panel edges.\nLow-cut opening: A padded collar and small rear pull loop finish the photographed heel profile.\nEVA outsole: The actual forefoot view shows an oval central section with surrounding grooves and textured contact zones.\nWholesale colour-size options: Black and Khaki are offered in EU 39–48 for assortment planning.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
